      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "IMAGE 2 supplies planting and flower-bed cues only. It is enabled but deliberately weak (inspiration fidelity 0.75) so it does not replace the source composition. Raise 0.75 carefully for more inspiration influence; lower it if the source drifts."
