      "title": "Fidelity controls",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Krea2EditModelPatch dials: first value = inspiration fidelity (0.75); second value = source fidelity (4.0). Lower inspiration to 0.3–0.5 if the layout drifts. Raise source to 5–6 for stricter preservation. Very high values can prevent useful edits."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
